meta {
  name: Get Last User Login
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/user/last_login
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Last User Login

  This request is used to get list of last user login. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Stats fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `login_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": [
      { "username": "Jan", "login_at": "2024-03-14 02:28:37" }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}